{"title":"Engineering summer programs","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Engineering summer programs</b> including robotics programs and summer camps.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#United_States\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">United States</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Elementary_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elementary school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Middle_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Middle school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#High_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">High school</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"United_States\">United States</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: United States\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elementary_school\">Elementary school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Elementary school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Boston-Harvard Univ., Silicon Valley-Stanford Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digital_Media_Adventures&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Digital Media Adventures (page does not exist)\">Digital Media Adventures</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.digitalmediaadventures.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ID_Tech_Camps\" title=\"ID Tech Camps\">iD Tech Camps</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.internaldrive.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_school\">Middle school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Middle school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Mathematics,_Science,_and_Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Center for Mathematics, Science, and Technology (page does not exist)\">Center for Mathematics, Science, and Technology</a> (CMST) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemast.illinoisstate.edu/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Boston-Harvard Univ., Silicon Valley-Stanford Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digital_Media_Academy&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Digital Media Academy (page does not exist)\">Digital Media Academy</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.digitalmediaacademy.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digital_Media_Adventures&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Digital Media Adventures (page does not exist)\">Digital Media Adventures</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.digitalmediaadventures.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ID_Tech_Camps\" title=\"ID Tech Camps\">iD Tech Camps</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.internaldrive.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Competitive_Programming_Bootcamp\" title=\"MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp\">MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/competitive-program/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Ethical_Hacking_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ Ethical Hacking Camp\">MehtA+ Ethical Hacking Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/intro-to-ethical-hacking/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Summer_Camp_in_Robotics,_Engineering,_and_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Summer Camp in Robotics, Engineering, and Mathematics (page does not exist)\">Summer Camp in Robotics, Engineering, and Mathematics</a> (SCREAM) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.southalabama.edu/cce/kids.html\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"High_school\">High school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: High school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Mathematics,_Science,_and_Technology&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Center for Mathematics, Science, and Technology (page does not exist)\">Center for Mathematics, Science, and Technology</a> (CMST) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathismylife.org/index.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Boston-Harvard Univ., Silicon Valley-Stanford Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digital_Media_Academy&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Digital Media Academy (page does not exist)\">Digital Media Academy</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.digitalmediaacademy.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ID_Tech_Camps\" title=\"ID Tech Camps\">iD Tech Camps</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.internaldrive.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Competitive_Programming_Bootcamp\" title=\"MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp\">MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/competitive-program/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Ethical_Hacking_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ Ethical Hacking Camp\">MehtA+ Ethical Hacking Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/intro-to-ethical-hacking/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Student_Introduction_to_Engineering&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Student Introduction to Engineering (page does not exist)\">Student Introduction to Engineering</a> (SITE) at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Alabama&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Alabama (page does not exist)\">University of Alabama</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Summer_STEM_Institute&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Summer STEM Institute (page does not exist)\">Summer STEM Institute</a> (SSI) is a virtual-first program <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.summersteminstitute.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://talariasummerinstitute.org/\">Talaria Summer Institute</a> is a free summer STEM research mentorship program for female and genderqueer students</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_summer_programs\" title=\"Academic summer programs\">Academic summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering\" title=\"Engineering\">Engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_books&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Engineering books (page does not exist)\">Engineering books</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://notesvarsity.com/\">Free Engineering Books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scho